Admission Fabric

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Admission Fabric is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for deciding whether AI work should be admitted to accelerator infrastructure based on capacity reservation, quota, predicted resource demand, and SLO feasibility.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Admission Fabric does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Admission Fabric accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
